{"pageid":3481,"title":"Version 1.34.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.34.0</span>","revid":15618,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.34.0\">Version 1.34.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 4th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Secret Update Friday Content (R, ET)</li>\n<li>Added weather (sunny, cloudy, rain, lightning</li>\n<li>Added firefly particles around firefly <a href=\"/wiki/Jar\" title=\"Jar\">jars</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\">Skull Rock</a> is now based off of explosive blast pressure</li>\n<li>Items now take 30 minutes to despawn</li>\n<li>Buffed <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Axe\" title=\"Living Axe\">living axe</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Fireflies\" title=\"Fireflies\">fireflies</a> not appearing</li>\n<li>A new fix attempt for vehicles flinging</li>\n<li>Fixed trailers/vehicles randomly respawning at a location</li>\n<li>Fixed tool hit indicators locking onto the tool itself</li>\n<li>More misc. bug fixes!</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.34.1\">Version 1.34.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 4th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Changed <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Tree</a> plank color</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163737\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive pa